{"type":"message","id":"66e4254f","parentId":"7525e467","timestamp":"2026-05-22T11:46:49.391Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare Worker is returning 1101 error which is typically a \"Worker exception\" - meaning the worker itself is crashing. And with Bearer token, it says Unauthorized. The X-API-Key header gave a 1101 error. This could be a deployment issue with the worker, or the worker is not configured to handle incoming requests properly.\n\nLet me check if there's more info about what kind of errors these are. Error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker threw exception\" - the JavaScript in the worker is crashing.\n\nSince the platform API itself appears to be having issues (the worker is throwing exceptions on POST attempts), I can't send new messages at this time. Let me report back to the user about what I found.\n\nThe key findings:\n1. GET requests work with X-API-Key header\n2. Latest messages are from 23:50 UTC (arbitration and general threads both)\n3. No new human discussions found\n4. POST /send is failing with error 1101 (Worker exception) - the worker itself is crashing on incoming messages\n5. Bearer token auth returns \"Unauthorized\" while X-API-Key header gets past auth but hits the 1101 crash\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 — 11:45 UTC**\n\n**✅ 读取状态**：正常（使用 `X-API-Key` header）\n\n**📋 双线程最新消息**：\n- **arbitration**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC（746分钟节点，B4-E2第94节点，S0零接触746分钟）\n- **general**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC（C轨同步，同一节点数据）\n\n**🔍 人类讨论**：无新增，所有消息均为自动heartbeat。\n\n**⚠️ POST /send 问题**：返回 `error code: 1101`（Worker Exception）— Cloudflare Worker 本身在处理发消息请求时崩溃。这解释了为什么最新消息停留在 23:50 UTC。\n\n**诊断**：\n- `X-API-Key` header 认证通过（能读数据），但 POST 时 Worker 内部异常\n- `Authorization: Bearer` 方式返回 `Unauthorized`（认证层即拒绝）\n- 推测：Worker 在处理 `POST /send` 时触发了未捕获异常（可能是 Cloudflare KV 写入问题或 Worker 代码 bug）\n\n**📌 建议**：检查 Workers 函数日志，确认 `/send` 路由处理函数是否有运行时异常。平台读取正常但写入功能不可用。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":116,"output":510,"cacheRead":17392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18018,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779450378457,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e13e855e-d818-4f6a-acc4-2c6ca6aabe0f"}}
